
Note: You can run this program from this build directory (but not from the src
directory).

If you would like to install it:

--------------

cd src
make

cd ..
./install.sh

----- OR -----

cd  src
make

cd ..
su root
./install-root.sh

--------------

The install scripts are very simple, but best practice suggestes that you take
a minute to read them before you run them.

--

You will also need to install libssh2 (http://www.libssh2.org)

